fact WorkItem(id: "WI-058", description: some(value: "prototype gc_arena vs concrete tracer for eval-time cycle handling. Spike in a branch between M4 and M5 — measure 'gc-lifetime pollution cost against the actually-built eval + resolver code (Substitution<Value> from 026.1 Q1 + LogicalStream from M4 are in scope by then). Cycles don't arise until M5 Modify[store] with store cells closing over closures; v1 refcount (WI-055) is correct until then. Decide based on: (a) ripple of 'gc into Interpreter/Substitution/Frame signatures; (b) derive(Collect) coverage on held types (SmallVec, SearchStream, persistence types); (c) mutator-threading ergonomics for builtins + host embedding; (d) safepoint discipline cost. Outcome is a decision + write-up in docs/proposals/, not a shipped implementation."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: ["WI-048"]), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: PreOpened)
